Requirement 1: Basic banking operations for every account
Every bank account (whatever its type) must have an account number, holder name, and balance, and must support deposit() and withdraw(). This goes in the parent class Account.
Requirement 2: Savings accounts earn interest and limit withdrawals
A savings account is an account that also earns interest (addInterest()) and cannot be withdrawn from below a minimum balance. This goes in the child class SavingsAccount, which inherits everything from Account and adds or overrides only what is specific to it.
